title: Post3Rs

A 3-week workshop (could also be run over a weekend or something similar).

Use [[The 3Rs]] as design strategies.

!! [[Reduce]]

* Pick a design work you've already created.
* Explore "reducing" the project in as many ways as you can...
** List of reduction examples?
** [[Good Design Is as Little Design as Possible]]
*** This idea is part of Modernism, "Less Is More" and all, so there are stylistic opportunities that this as a strategy might help with.
*** Obviously there is more to think about than that, but that's one place to start.
